sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Src as Data source
    participant Rd as Streaming reader
    participant Proc as Processing
    participant Agg as Aggregation
    participant Out as Output
    Src->>Rd: a file or stream far larger than memory
    loop line at a time
        Rd->>Proc: one record
        Proc->>Proc: parse, skip malformed rather than crash
        Proc->>Agg: fold into a counter or heap
    end
    Note over Rd,Agg: never read it all in — the interview file is always bigger than the laptop
    Agg->>Out: top-N, percentile, or merged ranges
    Out-->>Src: exit code and a summary a human can read
    Note over Proc: idempotent, dry-run capable, and it logs what it touched
